WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The agent coordinates. Soher Docs tailors the document.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
One workflow. Distinct responsibilities.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Useful drafts start with useful inputs.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Current example: tailor a CV to a role.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:20.000
The CV walkthrough shows the full journey.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Tailoring should not invent the facts.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:52.000
A CV is the example. Documents are the wider direction.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:08.000
What document does your workflow need?
